{"unit":77,"section":3,"cefr":"A1","objective":"make poetic descriptions","skill":"Diminutives","heading":"Make poetic descriptions","phrases":[{"he":"העלים האדמדמים נופלים לאדמה.","en":"The reddish leaves are falling to the ground.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/73a5a2396a27c5ae9f4df78f38646ae0","tokens":[{"w":"העלים","h":["the leaves"]},{"w":"האדמדמים","h":["reddish"]},{"w":"נופלים","h":["fall","falling"]},{"w":"לאדמה","h":["to the ground"]}]},{"he":"הידית מסתובבת והדלת נפתחת.","en":"The handle turns and the door is opened.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/26ac429632f034f48600e385ac43ee7b","tokens":[{"w":"הידית","h":["the handle"]},{"w":"מסתובבת","h":["turns","is hanging around","spins"]},{"w":"והדלת","h":["and the door"]},{"w":"נפתחת","h":["is opened"]}]},{"he":"הגחליליות מופיעות בשדה בלילה.","en":"The fireflies appear in the field at night.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/a6d3851b4af15d5f1ad300776fc9d481","tokens":[{"w":"הגחליליות","h":["the fireflies"]},{"w":"מופיעות","h":["appear","perform"]},{"w":"בשדה","h":["in the field"]},{"w":"בלילה","h":["in the night","at night","after midnight"]}]},{"he":"החתלתול הקטנטן יושב על הצלוחית.","en":"The tiny kitten is sitting on the saucer.","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/ba818d47a09a6cde6be843e74e0e4a59","tokens":[{"w":"החתלתול","h":["the kitten"]},{"w":"הקטנטן","h":["tiny"]},{"w":"יושב","h":["is sitting","sits","sit"]},{"w":"על","h":["on","on top of","over"]},{"w":"הצלוחית","h":["the saucer"]}]}],"words":[{"he":"העלים","en":"the leaves","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"האדמדמים","en":"reddish","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נופלים","en":"falling","alt":["fall"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"לאדמה","en":"to the ground","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"הידית","en":"the handle","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"מסתובבת","en":"turns","alt":["is hanging around","spins"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"והדלת","en":"and the door","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"נפתחת","en":"is opened","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"הגחליליות","en":"the fireflies","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"מופיעות","en":"appear","alt":["perform"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"בלילה","en":"at night","alt":["after midnight","in the night"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"החתלתול","en":"the kitten","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"הקטנטן","en":"tiny","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"הצלוחית","en":"the saucer","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"בשדה","en":"in the field","alt":[],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"יושב","en":"is sitting","alt":["sits","sit"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"על","en":"on","alt":["on top of","over"],"from":"phrase"}],"lexemes":["הפילון","צלוחית","המחשבון","מגבון","דובונים","הגחליליות","החזרזירים","הדובון","גחלילית","למגבונים","הספרון","חזרזיר","לפילון","קשית","שקיות","האדמדמים","המלונית","הידית","כלבלבים","הירקרק","ירקרק","אדמדמה","ידית","אדמדם","כחלחלה","שקית","כחלחל","מלונית","הקשית","קשיות","הכלבלב"],"tips":"In Hebrew, many diminutives are formed by reduplicating the last two consonants of a 3-consonant root.   \nFor example, כלב (dog) turns into כלבלב (puppy). קטן (small) turns into קטנטן (tiny).\n\nOther options exist for creating smaller versions of already existing words, such as the ending ית-:  \nמלון - hotel (or בית מלון)  \nמלונית - motel  \nand the ending ון-:  \nדוב - bear  \nדובון - teddy bear"}